summary:
  mpris.py numbers in milliseconds for a widget that did not ask.

history:
  2026.39 keeps the command number in a 32-bit int and runs on between an
  update landing on disk and the next plasmashell start. A moment wraps that
  int, every line reads as new on every read, and one Next walks through the
  stations. This drops the counter the bridge keeps for it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/mpris.py

find:
      if not moments:

replace:
      if False:

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_mpris_seq.py::test_without_the_flag_the_bridge_counts_as_2026_39_expects.
  Line-neutral.
